        		<ol start="10" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Indicate rainwater disposal from building and from all property areas, to City-standard catch basins on the property. Give catch basin depths (in feet) and necessary site grading, contours, and slopes to ensure disposal of water to on-site drains. Paved parking areas require drainage swales. See the Engineering Services Department for the procedure before completing the drainage plan.</span></span></span></span></li>
