        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:80px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The following information shall be shown on architectural/engineering drawings or in specifications:</span></span></span></span></p>
        
