        <p>Date Passed: Monday, February 21, 2005</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, March 30, 2005</p><p>ORD C33578 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.010.230">Section 17G.010.230</a> Applications for Engineering Services Private Projects<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The following application materials are required as a part of an engineering services private project application. Some of these application requirements may be waived or modified by the director of engineering services as the nature of the work applied for dictates. The items listed below would be provided by the developer of the project, a professional engineer or architect licensed in the state of Washington, or by the City. Design for sewer, water or street is to be in accordance with the current Standard Specifications for Road, Bridge and Municipal Construction by the Washington State Department of Transportation and the American Public Works Association; <a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.060"><span style="color:blue">chapter SMC 17D.060</span></a> the City of Spokane Stormwater Ordinance and any approved amendments or addenda thereto, the City of Spokane Supplemental Specifications thereto; and the City of Spokane Design Standards &ndash; Engineering Services Department. The current requirements for a geotechnical report or drainage report are included within this document. A water hydraulics study, sewer study or erosion and sediment control study/plan is to be prepared by a professional engineer in such a manner as to show system adequacy for providing the necessary water or sewer utility to the project area or for protecting the project area from stormwater damage or the surrounding property from stormwater intrusion.</span></span></span></span></p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Private or Public Sanitary Sewer System</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Prior to design approval, the following information is required:</span></span></span></span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
