        <p>REPEALED&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060.240">Section 17G.060.240</a> REPEALED (Expiration of Permits)<br />
        <p>REPEALED&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060.245">Section 17G.060.245</a> REPEALED (Recision and Remanding of Shoreline Permits)<br />
        <p>REPEALED&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060.250">Section 17G.060.250</a> REPEALED (Optional Consolidated Project Permit Review Process)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060.260">Section 17G.060.260</a> REPEALED (Conflicting Ordinances)<br />
        <p>REPEALED&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060.270">Section 17G.060.270</a> REPEALED (Severability)<br />
        <p>REPEALED&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 33</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=17G.060T">Chapter 17G.060T</a> REPEALED (Land Use Application Tables)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060T.001">Section 17G.060T.001</a> REPEALED (Table 17G.060-1 Applications Subject to Review)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 34</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060T.002">Section 17G.060T.002</a> REPEALED (Table 17G.060-2 Content of Public Notice)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 34</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.060T.003">Section 17G.060T.003</a> REPEALED (Table 17G.060-3 Type of Public Notice Required / Project Permit Review Process)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 34</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=17G.061">Chapter 17G.061</a> Land Use Application Procedures</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.061.000">Section 17G.061.000</a> Purpose and Administration<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Purpose.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The purpose of this chapter is to establish standard procedures for the review and processing of land use applications through the establishment of complete application standards, review procedures, notice requirements, hearing processes, decision criteria<u>,</u> and appeal procedures for all applications.</span></span></span></span></p>
        
        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Administration.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Responsibility for the administration, application<u>,</u> and interpretation of these procedures pursuant to this ordinance is as set forth below.</span></span></span></span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Director of Development Services or their designee is responsible for&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.050" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.050 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">, Division F;&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.010" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.010 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">, Division I; and the development codes.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="2" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Director of Engineering Services or their designee is responsible for&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.020" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.020 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.070" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.070 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.010" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.010 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.050" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.050 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.080" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.080 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">, Division H<u>,</u> and the development codes.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="3" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Director of Planning Services or designee is responsible for&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Title=17B" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">Title 17B SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Title=17C" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">Title 17C SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.010" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.010 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.060" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.060 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.080" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.080 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17D.090" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17D.090 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.020" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.020 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.030" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.030 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.040" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.040 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.050" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.050 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.060" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.060 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17E.070" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17E.070 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.020" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.020 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.030" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.030 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.040" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.040 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.061" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.061 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.070" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.070 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">, and&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="http://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=17G.080" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white">chapter 17G.080 SMC</span></a><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol start="2">
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The procedures for requesting interpretations of the land use codes and development codes shall be made by the department and may be contained under the specific codes.</span></span></span></span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="3" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Exclusions per RCW 36.70B.140.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The following are excluded from the project permit review process, associated time frames, and other provisions of these procedures:</span></span></span></span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Landmark designations;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="2" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">street vacations;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="3" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">approvals related to the use of public areas or facilities;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="4" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">project permits that, by ordinance or resolution, have been determined to present special circumstances warranting a review process different from that provided in this chapter.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="5" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Lot line or boundary adjustments;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="6" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">final short subdivisions;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="7" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">final binding site plans;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="8" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">final plats; and</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol style="list-style-type:lower-roman">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">building or other construction permits, or similar administrative approvals categorically exempt from environmental review under RCW 43.21C, or for which environmental review has been completed in conjunction with other project permits and are judged by the director to adequately address the current application.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol start="2">
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Applications for interior alterations are excluded, provided they do not result in the following:</span></span></span></span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Additional sleeping quarters or bedrooms;</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="2" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Nonconformity with Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA) substantial improvement thresholds; or</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="list-style-type:none">
        		<ol start="3" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
        			<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Increase the total square footage or valuation of the structure<u>,</u> thereby requiring upgraded fire access or fire suppression systems.</span></span></span></span></li>
        		</ol>
        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="4" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Conflicting Ordinances.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">If any provision of the ordinance codified in this title or its application to any person or circumstance is held invalid, the remainder of the ordinance codified in this title or the application of its provisions to other persons or circumstances shall not be affected.</span></span></span></span></p>
        
        <ol start="5" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Severability.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">To the extent there is a conflict between this chapter and other ordinances or resolutions for the City of Spokane regulating project permits, this chapter shall govern.</span></span></span></span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, October 20, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Friday, November 28, 2025</p><p>ORD C36753 Section 50</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17G.061.010">Section 17G.061.010</a> Summary of Land Use Application Procedures<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Table 17G.061.010-1 summarizes the applications subject to this chapter. For any application type that is referenced in the land use codes, but not represented in Table 17G.061.010-1, the process shall be as identified in the application most closely associated with the application process definitions in SMC 17G.061.100.</span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
