        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:Univers,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The following Type II and III applications shall meet these requirements in addition to the provisions of subsection (B) of this section:</span></span></span></span></p>
        
