        			<ol style="list-style-type:lower-roman">
        				<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:Univers,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">the boundary of the parcels(s) of land upon which the development is proposed;</span></span></span></span></li>
