        				<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:Univers,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">a delineation of all wetland areas that will be altered or used as a part of the development;</span></span></span></span></li>
